@startuml activity_diagram
title Krillion Defense - Activity Diagram: Checking an Answer
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false

start
:Player types an answer;
:Clean up the answer;
if (Answer is on the list?) then (yes)
  :Get its level (1-5);
  :Give the reward;
else (no)
  :No reward;
endif
stop
@enduml
